#. type: TH
#: unity.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "unity"
msgstr "unity"

#. type: TH
#: unity.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "9 December 2010"
msgstr "9 decembre 2010"

#. type: TH
#: unity.1:1 unity-panel-service.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Linux User's Manual"
msgstr "Linux: manual del usator"

#. type: SH
#: unity.1:3 unity-panel-service.1:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NOMINE"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:5
msgid "unity - wrapper for starting the unity shell and handling fallback"
msgstr "unity - wrapper pro initiar le shell  de unity e gerer le reservas"

#. type: SH
#: unity.1:6 unity-panel-service.1:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:9
msgid "B<unity> [I<options>]"
msgstr "B<unity> [I<optiones>]"

#. type: SH
#: unity.1:11 unity-panel-service.1:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:13
msgid ""
"The B<unity> program can be used to start the Unity shell as a compiz "
"module, and to specify how to handle logging, debugging, as well as how to "
"deal with the user's profile."
msgstr ""
"Te  programma B<unity>  pote ser usate pro initiar le shell de Unity qual un "
"modulo compiz, e pro specificar how quomodo gerer le connexiones, le "
"correstiones, e como tractar le profilo del usator."

#. type: SH
#: unity.1:14 unity-panel-service.1:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPTIONES"

#. type: IP
#: unity.1:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--advanced-debug>"
msgstr "B<--correction-avantiate>"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:17
msgid ""
"Runs unity under debugging (using GDB or another debugger tool) to help "
"tracking issues. Should only be used on request from a developper following "
"a bug report."
msgstr ""
"Face fluer Unity in modo recerca defectos (per GDB o un altere application "
"de recerca defectos) pro adjutar traciar le problemas.  Deberea esser usate "
"solmente sur requesta de un disveloppator que seque un reporto de defecto."

#. type: IP
#: unity.1:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--log>\\ I<filename>"
msgstr "B<--log>\\ I<filename>"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:20
msgid ""
"This parameter, followed by a path or filename, tells the Unity shell to "
"store logs in the specified file."
msgstr ""
"Iste parametro, succedite per un percurso o nomine de file, indica al shell "
"de Unity de salvar le registrationes in un file."

#. type: IP
#: unity.1:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--reset>"
msgstr "B<--reset>"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:23
msgid ""
"This option allows the user to reset profile parameters in compiz and "
"restart the Unity shell with default settings."
msgstr ""
"Iste option permitte le usator restaurar le parametros del profilo in compiz "
"e reinitiar le shell de Unity con le configurationes predefinite."

#. type: IP
#: unity.1:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--verbose>"
msgstr "B<--verbose>"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:26
msgid ""
"This option turns on displaying additional debugging output for the Unity "
"shell. It can be used by the user to debug configuration issues. This option "
"is often used along with the B<--log> option to save output to a file."
msgstr ""
"Iste option activa le visualisation de emissiones additional de recerca "
"defectos pro le shell de Unity. Illo pote esser usate per le usator pro "
"correction del problemas de configuration. Iste option es usate sovente qual "
"option de B<--log> pro salvar le emission in un file."

#. type: SH
#: unity.1:27 unity-panel-service.1:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr "VIDE ETIAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity.1:29
msgid "B<unity-panel-service> (1)"
msgstr "B<unity-panel-service> (1)"

#. type: TH
#: unity-panel-service.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "unity-panel-service"
msgstr "unity-panel-service"

#. type: TH
#: unity-panel-service.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "8 December 2010"
msgstr "8 decembre 2010"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity-panel-service.1:5
msgid ""
"unity-panel-service - program for drawing the panel with the unity shell."
msgstr ""
"unity-panel-service - programmma pro designar le quadro de unity per le "
"shell."

#. type: Plain text
#: unity-panel-service.1:8
msgid "B<unity-panel-service>"
msgstr "B<unity-panel-service>"

#. type: Plain text
#: unity-panel-service.1:12
msgid ""
"The B<unity-panel-service> program is normally started automatically by the "
"Unity shell (which gets started as a compiz module) and is used to draw "
"panels which can then be used for the global menu, or to hold indicators."
msgstr ""
"Le programma B<unity-panel-service> es normalmente lanceate automaticamente "
"per le shell de Unity (que es lanceate tal como un modulo compiz) e es usate "
"pro designar quadros que pois pote ser usate pro le menu global, o pro tener "
"indicatores."

#. type: Plain text
#: unity-panel-service.1:15
msgid "B<unity-panel-service> takes no options."
msgstr "B<unity-panel-service> Non tene ulle option."

#. type: SH
#: unity-panel-service.1:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr "NOTAS"
